  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3116,
      "text": "And fear the One Who created you and the former peoples[23].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 184,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 325,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3117,
      "text": "They said, “You are truly bewitched!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 185,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 325,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3118,
      "text": "You are only a human being like us, and we think you are nothing but a liar.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 186,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 325,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3119,
      "text": "So cause pieces of the sky to fall upon us, if you are of the truthful.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 187,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 325,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3120,
      "text": "Shu‘ayb said, “My Lord knows best whatever you do.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 188,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 325,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3121,
      "text": "Thus they rejected him, so they were seized by the punishment of the cloudy day; it was the punishment of a horrible day.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 189,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 325,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3122,
      "text": "Indeed, there is a sign in this, yet most of them would not believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 190,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 325,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3123,
      "text": "Your Lord is indeed the All-Mighty, the Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 191,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 325,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3124,
      "text": "This is indeed a revelation from the Lord of the worlds,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 192,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3125,
      "text": "which the Trustworthy Spirit [Gabriel] has brought down",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 193,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3126,
      "text": "to your heart [O Prophet] so that you may be one of the warners,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 194,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3127,
      "text": "in a clear Arabic language.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 195,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3128,
      "text": "And it was indeed [mentioned] in the scriptures of the former peoples.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 196,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3129,
      "text": "Was it not a proof for them that the learned men of the Children of Israel recognized it [to be true][24]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 197,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3130,
      "text": "If We had sent it down to any of the non-Arabs,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 198,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3131,
      "text": "and he had recited it to them[25]; still, they would not have believed in it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 199,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3132,
      "text": "This is how We made it [i.e., disbelief] enter the hearts of the wicked.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 200,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3133,
      "text": "They will not believe in it until they see the painful punishment,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 201,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3134,
      "text": "which will come upon them suddenly when they least expect it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 202,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3135,
      "text": "They will then say, “Can we be granted some respite?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 203,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3136,
      "text": "Do they really seek to hasten Our punishment?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 204,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3137,
      "text": "Tell me [O Prophet] if We give them a life of ease for years,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 205,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 375,
      "ruku": 326,
      "hizbQuarter": 150,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3138,
      "text": "then there came to them what they were warned of,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
